# Optional CARTO Basemaps API Key (Server-Side Only)
# Stored securely on the server backend. Never prefix with VITE_ to prevent frontend bundle leaks.
# If set, the server proxy (/api/tiles/streets/*) securely authenticates upstream CARTO requests.
# If unset, the server proxy cleanly falls back to anonymous CARTO Voyager / OpenStreetMap tiles.
CARTO_API_KEY=
